---
export const prerender = true;

import Layout from "../../layout/Layout.astro";
import "../../components/booking-board.css";
import "../../components/content-page.css";

const joinGuide = "https://wiki.vatsim-scandinavia.org/books/getting-started-AVr/chapter/joining-vatsim-scandinavia";
const trainingEmail = "mailto:training-director@vatsim-scandinavia.org";
---

<Layout SiteTitle="Contact us | VATSIM Scandinavia">
  <main class="content-page">
    <div class="page-intro">
      <h1>Contact us</h1>
      <p>Find the right team for your question below. For general chat with the community, join our Discord.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="page-cards">
      <section class="booking-board page-card" aria-labelledby="contact-training-title">
        <div class="booking-board-heading"><h2 id="contact-training-title">Requesting ATC training</h2></div>
        <div class="page-card-body">
          <p>First, make sure you've <a href={joinGuide} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">joined VATSIM Scandinavia</a> properly. If the issue still persists, contact the Training Department.</p>
        </div>
        <a class="booking-footer" href={trainingEmail}>Email the Training Department <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </section>

      <section class="booking-board page-card" aria-labelledby="contact-transfer-title">
        <div class="booking-board-heading"><h2 id="contact-transfer-title">Changing your subdivision or vACC</h2></div>
        <div class="page-card-body">
          <p>Read the <a href={joinGuide} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">instructions on how to join VATSIM Scandinavia</a>. If you still have an issue, contact the Training Department.</p>
        </div>
        <a class="booking-footer" href={trainingEmail}>Email the Training Department <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </section>

      <section class="booking-board page-card" aria-labelledby="contact-docs-title">
        <div class="booking-board-heading"><h2 id="contact-docs-title">Airport documentation or downloads</h2></div>
        <div class="page-card-body">
          <p>Found something wrong, missing or outdated? Contact the director of the FIR it belongs to.</p>
        </div>
        <a class="booking-footer" href="/about/staff/">Find your FIR director <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </section>

      <section class="booking-board page-card" aria-labelledby="contact-tech-title">
        <div class="booking-board-heading"><h2 id="contact-tech-title">Technical issues</h2></div>
        <div class="page-card-body">
          <p>Something not working on our websites or services? Report it to the Web Department.</p>
        </div>
        <a class="booking-footer" href="mailto:tech@vatsim-scandinavia.org">Email the Web Department <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </section>

      <section class="booking-board page-card" aria-labelledby="contact-feedback-title">
        <div class="booking-board-heading"><h2 id="contact-feedback-title">Feedback</h2></div>
        <div class="page-card-body">
          <p>Want to tell us about your experience with our controllers? Send your feedback through Control Center.</p>
        </div>
        <a class="booking-footer" href="https://cc.vatsim-scandinavia.org/feedback" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Leave feedback <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </section>

      <section class="booking-board page-card" aria-labelledby="contact-discord-title">
        <div class="booking-board-heading"><h2 id="contact-discord-title">Discord</h2></div>
        <div class="page-card-body">
          <p>Chat with the community on our Discord server. It isn't intended for support requests; please use the contacts above.</p>
        </div>
        <a class="booking-footer" href="https://discord.vatsim-scandinavia.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Join our Discord <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
